    "body": "Add opt-in Turbo cross-entropy dispatch for Megatron TP=1 BF16/FP32 training, preserving per-token loss and layout semantics. Both enablement and logits-overwrite flags default off; unsupported configurations retain the existing implementation.\n\nValidation: five GPU integration tests passed, covering gradient propagation, storage modes and fallbacks. Requires [Primus-Turbo #548](https://github.com/AMD-AGI/Primus-Turbo/pull/548).\n",
